                    "value": "Conversion falls monotonically with contact intensity: 13.0% on the first contact of a campaign, 9.4% by the fourth, 3.1% past the eleventh. Repeated calling does not wear prospects down, it burns them. Combined with the channel gap - 14.7% on mobile against 5.2% on landline - the operational read is to call each prospect on a mobile once, and spend the saved calls on new names.",
